#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Use the shortcode [currencywiki_converter] or add the Currency Kit block in the Gutenberg editor."
msgstr "Uża l-shortcode [currencywiki_converter] jew żid il-blokk Currency Kit fl-editor Gutenberg."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Can I customize the widget colors?"
msgstr "Nista' nippersonalizza l-kuluri tal-widget?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Yes! Go to Currency Kit → Dashboard and select your preferred accent color from the color palette."
msgstr "Iva! Mur għal Currency Kit → Dashboard u agħżel il-kulur ta' accent preferut tiegħek mill-paletta tal-kuluri."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "How often are exchange rates updated?"
msgstr "Kemm spiss jiġu aġġornati l-kambji tal-munita?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Exchange rates are updated in real-time from Currency.Wiki API."
msgstr "Il-kambji tal-munita jiġu aġġornati f'ħin reali mill-API ta' Currency.Wiki."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Need More Help?"
msgstr "Għandek Bżonn Aktar Għajnuna?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Contact our support team or visit our documentation for more information."
msgstr "Ikkuntattja t-tim tal-appoġġ tagħna jew żur id-dokumenti tagħna għal aktar informazzjoni."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Get Support"
msgstr "Ikseb Appoġġ"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Display currency converter on your sidebar. (Legacy V2 widget - consider using the Gutenberg block instead)"
msgstr "Uri konvertitur tal-munita fuq il-sidebar tiegħek. (Widget V2 ta' legat - ikkunsidra li tuża l-blokk Gutenberg minflok)"

